     "titulo": "Nominalizations and formal register",
     "texto": [
      "Terms include nouns such as **διατήρηση** and **επεξεργασία**. Look for the agent, the purpose and the time limit; don't assume unlimited consent.",
      "Notice what relationship each connector sets up and use it to express your own position."
